N\">CNN</a> AI 时代垃圾非常多</div></p><hr/>\n<p><strong>#98 tw93</strong>：<div class=\"reply_content\">@<a href=\"/member/JieGaLee\">JieGaLee</a> 谢谢喜欢！</div></p><hr/>\n<p><strong>#99 tw93</strong>：<div class=\"reply_content\">@<a href=\"/member/timekiller\">timekiller</a> 我来加油！不过浅色在这里会不那么搭配，你是是菜单栏还是全部</div></p><hr/>\n<p><strong>#100 oyjt</strong>：<div class=\"reply_content\">挺好的产品，试用看看</div></p><hr/>","i":"","t":"2026-09-04","p":"","n":0},"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1576426.htm":{"c":"<html><body><div><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"artibody\">\n                        <p class=\"article-global\"></p>                            <p><img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/dbc1f17da43c15f.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/fae8475aadc64f7.jpg\"><br></p><p><img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/98c9d818706a074.jpg\"><br></p><p><img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/2330a22966078d3.png\"><br></p><p>有网友提醒，购买这类代认证服务，需要登录账号并绑定他人实名学籍资料，极易引发账号被盗、个人隐私泄露等安全问题。</p><p>对此，腾讯客服表示，“目前高校频道/认证功能测试已正式结束，功能暂时已下线，后续若有该功能的相关活动，游戏内公告、官方公众号等渠道会第一时间通知大家。”</p><p><img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/0ba68fff6587ab7.jpg\"><br></p><p>腾讯客服建议消费者，通过王者荣耀唯一官方认证公众号“王者荣耀”获取游戏一手资讯和专属福利，切勿通过非官方二手平台交易，以免个人信息泄露或遭受财产损失。</p>                        </div>\n                    </div></body></html>","i":"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0904/dbc1f17da43c15f.png","t":"2026-09-04","p":"","n":0},"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239359":{"c":"<div class=\"topic_content\"><a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/92kaywv.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/92kaywv.png\"/></a><br/> å‰�æ®µæ—¶é—´ä¹°äº†ä¸ªä¸´æœŸ 20XPro å�¯ä»¥çˆ½è¹¬äº†</div>\n<hr/><h3>评论</h3>\n<p><strong>#1 ntdll</strong>：<div class=\"reply_content\">æˆ‘ç�°åœ¨çš„æƒ³æ³•å’Œ reddit ä¸Šä¸€æ ·ï¼Œå…¶å®�å�§ï¼Œå’±ä¹Ÿä¸�æ˜¯é��è¦�é‚£ä¸ªé‡�ç½®ï¼Œå°±æ˜¯è§‰å¾— astra ä¹